# Only task specs, score summaries (results/<label>.json and a short results/<label>.md note)
# and this folder's README are committed.
# Assets, renders, references, ledgers and transcripts stay on the PC.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/judge.py
!/tasks/
!/results/
/tasks/*
!/tasks/*.yaml
/results/*
!/results/*.json
!/results/*.md
